---
title: "Kori Data Flow & Command Flow"
---

flowchart TD
  %% User entry
  User["User"] -->|Executes CLI| KoriCLI["kori CLI"]
  KoriCLI -->|Dispatch| Main["main"]
  Main -->|error handling| OsExit["os.Exit"]

  %% Configuration loading
  Main -->|Load Config| Settings["Settings"]
  Settings -->|Config paths| ConfigFile["user.kori.yml"]
  Settings -->|Search paths| ConfigDir["~/.config/kori"]
  Settings -->|Load template| ConfigTemplate["kori-example.yml"]
  Settings -->|Merged config| AgentConfig["agent.Config"]

  %% Command execution
  KoriCLI --> CmdRoot["cmd root"]
  KoriCLI --> CmdRemote["cmd remote"]
  KoriCLI --> CmdSandbox["cmd sandbox"]
  KoriCLI --> CmdSessions["cmd sessions"]
  KoriCLI --> CmdAudit["cmd audit"]
  KoriCLI --> CmdSearch["cmd search"]

  %% Subcommands
  CmdRemote --> RemoteList["remote list"]
  CmdRemote --> RemoteExec["remote exec"]
  CmdSandbox --> SandboxList["sandbox list"]
  CmdSandbox --> SandboxExec["sandbox exec"]
  CmdSessions --> SessionsList["sessions list"]
  CmdSessions --> SessionsRun["sessions run"]
  CmdSessions --> SessionsResume["sessions resume"]

  %% Agent creation
  Main -->|Create agent| Agent[rigolo__agent]
  Agent -->|Nacelle SDK| Nacelle[rigolo__nacelle]

  %% Provider configuration
  Agent -->|Select provider| Provider[rigolo__Provider]
  Provider -->|Choose backend| Anthropic[rigolo__cosette:anthropic]
  Provider -->|Choose backend| Google[rigolo__cosette:google]
  Provider -->|Choose backend| OpenAI[rigolo__cosette:openai]
  Provider -->|Choose backend| OpenRouter[rigolo__cosette:openrouter]

  %% Interact with providers
  Agent -->|Tool calls| Anthropic
  Agent -->|Tool calls| Google
  Agent -->|Tool calls| OpenAI
  Agent -->|Tool calls| OpenRouter

  %% Subsystems
  Agent --> Sessions["rigolo__Sessions"]
  Agent --> Sandbox["rigolo__Sandbox"]
  Agent --> Skills["rigolo__Skills"]
  Agent --> queue__Queue
  Agent --> punctuation__thoughts
  Agent --> decisions__result

  %% Session execution
  Sessions -->|Start session| SessionStart["Session start"]
  SessionStart -->|Create context| Context["rigolo__Ensemble__Context"]
  Context -->|Load memory| Memory["rigolo__Memory"]
  Context -->|Load skills| SkillContext["rigolo__Skills+Context"]

  %% Tool execution
  Context -->|Prepare tool call| ToolPrepare["Tool preparation"]
  ToolPrepare -->|Check approval| Approval["rigolo__Ensemble__Approval"]
  Approval -->|Allow| Provider
  Approval -->|Block| Agent

  %% Sandbox execution
  Sandbox -->|SSH connection| SSH["rigolo__cosette%SSH connection"]
  SSH -->|Execute command| SandboxExec
  Sandbox -->|Resolve target| RemoteTarget["rigolo__RemoteTarget"]

  %% Persistence
  Agent -->|Persist session| Historig__("rigolo__History")
  Historig__ -->|Log events| JEV["rigolo__jev"]
  Historig__ -->|Write to Journal| Journal["rigolo__Journal"]
  Historig__ -->|SQL storage| SQL["rigolo__Storage+SQL"]
  Historig__ -->|JSON snapshots| JSON["rigolo__Storage+JSON"]

  %% Compaction
  Agent -->|Compact history| Compaction["rigolo__Compaction"]
  Compaction -->|Check chair| Ledger["rigolo__ledger"]
  Compaction -->|Mark tombstone| Tombstone["rigolo__Tombstone"]
  Compaction -->|Apply plan| Plan["rigolo__plan"]

  %% Booking
  Agent -->|Track usage| Costs["rigolo__Cost"]
  Agent -->|Log usage| Usage["rigolo__Usage"]

  %% External services
  Agent -->|Report status| Herdr["rigolo__herdr socket"]
  Agent -->|Send heartbeat| Sonde["rigolo__sonde"]
  Agent -->|Read logs| Journal["rigolo__Journal"]
  Agent -->|Send mail| Courrier["rigolo__courrier"]
  Agent -->|Read alerts| Antenne["rigolo__antenne"]

  %% Background jobs
  Agent -->|Spawn job| Cron["rigolo__cron"]
  Cron -->|Execute schedule| BackgroundTasks["Background tasks"]

  %% Error handling
  Agent -->|UsageError| UsageError["rigolo__Ensemble__UsageError"]
  UsageError -->|Framework handles| Main
  Agent -->|RuntimeError| RuntimeError["RigoloRuntimeError"]
  RuntimeError -->|Main intercepts| Main

  %% Flow notes
  note for Main "Configuration loading from:\n- CLI flags\n- Settings directory\n- Template files"
  note for Agent "Core agent that:\n- Manages agent lifecycle\n- Routing tool calls\n- Isolates contexts\n- Tracks usage"
  note for Rigolo__Provider+"+Rigolo__cosette__Backends" "Provider selection based on:\n- ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\n- OPENAI_API_KEY\n- GOOGLE_API_KEY\n- OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
  note for Rigolo__Ensemble__UsageError "Signaled for usage/help errors\nCascades to os.Exit(2)"
  note for Rigolo__Ensemble__PassThrough "Runtime errors from agent\nCascades to os.Exit(1)"